WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 6.4 · MEAL: Monitoring, Evaluation, Accountability & Learning
Baselines and targets

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
When you are starting out, the starting point is now: capture it before your work begins.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Plan how to establish a missing baseline; never invent it.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Set targets that are ambitious but realistic.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Treat percentages from small first groups with care.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You set baselines, or plans to establish them, and targets.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
